window.products.push({"id":317226,"name":"The Great American Store 1800 Series Brushed Microfiber Bedspreads 4 PC Sheet Set Queen Size 100% Egyptian Quality Wrinkle and Fade Resistant White So","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71u3QCV0sqL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"Microfiber LUXURIOUS QUALITY 100% MICROFIBER hypoallergenic material, allergy protection for creating a healthy sleeping environment. EXPERTLY TAILORED - COMES WITH 1 FLAT SHEET, 1 FITTED SHEET AND 2 PILLOWCASES, Fits Queen Mattresses (60\"x 80\"). Deep pocket fitted sheet which fit mattresses up to 15' thick LASTING ELEGANCE - Fabric is mercerized to prevent color fade HIGH QUALITY CONSTRUCTION - Made with 1800 Series Egyptian Quality Microfiber for longevity and luxury. Fabric is pre-shrunk (Sanforized) to protect against shrinkage after washing and drying EASY CARE - Machine wash on cold, tumble dry on low","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71u3QCV0sqL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"The Great American","source_asin":"B019267AJG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-317226","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B019267AJG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B019267AJG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":317227,"name":"Clearance Sale-Kitchen Knife Sharpener,Unique 3-Stage Knife Sharpening Tool Helps Repair, Restore and Polish Blades (black)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61IrcRMblFL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"It's time to cut down on the amount of money you spend on replacement knives. This cobiz knife sharpener frees you from the chore of working with, struggling with, and ultimately replace all kinds of dulled knives. three different settings for your different purpose: --coarse, to help you put an edge back on chipped and/or noticeably dull knives> --medium, to keep regularly sharpened blades in good cutting and slicing condition --fine, to polish in daily maintenance and perfect for light touch-ups to an already sharp knife how to use your knife sharpener correctly: --chose a proper slots (coarse, medium, or fine) for your purpose. ---place the root of knife vertically into the slots. --pull from the knife roots to the tips. --repeat this process 5-10 times until satisfied with the condition of your knife. --enjoy having knives that slice things up easily, cleanly, and reliably again! matters that needs your attention: don't use the coarse slots unless your knives are very dull and obvious in a damged shape. don't run the blade back and forth, you must pull it in one direction from the knives roots to the tips. Check the fourth PIC for more details. don't sharpen your knife everyday, usually use it 2 -3 times a month. And pull 5-10 times in each usage. A tool, a gift, or both: -keep your butcher’s, chef’s, carving and paring knives keen enough to take on all kinds of delicious new culinary experiments with your new Kitchen Knife Sharpener> -Use this as a dedicated pocket Knife sharpener, ensuring that you’ll always have a way to make sure your Swiss Army and utility blades are in WORKING condition for your next hunting or camping trip -or treat your favorite chef a knife sharpener of their own so they can keep their most important tools in tip-top shape!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61IrcRMblFL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Cobiz","source_asin":"B077PKDKLW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-317227","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B077PKDKLW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B077PKDKLW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":317228,"name":"Eureka SuctionSeal Pet Bagless Upright Vacuum, AS1104A","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41-QD-RzndL._AC_.jpg","description":"Product Description The Eureka SuctionSeal bagless upright has concentrated suction for maximum cleaning on carpets and barefloors. Wide tubes that increase the amount of airflow for superior suction & cleaning. This unit picks up pet hair and liter from carpets and bare floors. This model maintains suction power as you vacuum your home. Amazon.com Deep Cleaning Power on All Floors. Proven to Clean Carpets Better Than Dyson DC25 and DC41 For Less Than ½ The Price,* the SuctionSeal™ PET bagless upright combines Eureka exclusive AirSpeed® Technology with SuctionSeal™ Technology for deep cleaning power on all floor surfaces. SuctionSeal Technology All-Surface Suction Plates concentrates airflow for deep cleaning suction power. As you move across carpet, hardwood or tile floors the plates raise and lower, creating a seal to maximize airflow for powerful cleaning performance. Whether it’s surface dirt or debris hiding in crevices, it’s sucked up and away without any scattering. AirSpeed Technology Unlike other vacuums, AirSpeed® Technology has two smooth tubes, featuring limited bends and turns. This allows more air to pass through the vacuum. The direct air path from floor to cup, decreases the distance for dirt to travel, which increases the amount of airflow for powerful suction. Never Loses Suction Eureka has engineered SuctionSeal™ to provide maximum suction power longer than other types of vacuums.* Tested to strict industry standards, Eureka’s multi-cyclonic dust cup system never loses suction and maintains power as you vacuum your home.^ Tough Enough for Pet Owners Designed to deep clean pet hair from carpets, bare floors, upholstery and more. The SuctionSeal™ Pet features a Pet Upholstery Brush, a turbo driven PET Power Paw®, and a 39 foot hose and wand to clean above the floors. The on/off brushroll switch lets you clean carpets and bare floors. This model includes an odor absorbing HEPA filter to eliminate pet odors and reduce allergens for a cleaner home. *Based on a comparison between (a) regular MSRP of Eureka SuctionSeal™ PET and Dyson DC25 and DC41 vacuums as of November 2011 (b) independent lab tests using industry standard ASTM F608 test, measuring embedded dirt removal from carpeting. *When compared to conventional bagged and single stage cyclonic vacuums having dirt cup filters. ^Eureka proves no loss of suction through IEC Test 60312-1 First Edition, Clause 5.9. Test results within variability tolerance of 5% Additional Product Features • All Surface Cleaning Designed to deep clean carpets, bare floors, upholstery and more. • Automatic Cord Rewind Rewinds cord effortlessly for quick and easy storage. • PET Power Paw® Turbo Brush Removes pet hair from carpet and upholstery. Plastic teeth loosen it, a rubber strip grabs it and bristles remove it. • Flip-Bottom Dust Cup Allows you to empty the dust cup quickly and easily without touching the captured dust. Emptying the dust cup regularly, as needed, will help to maintain optimum cleaning performance. • Washable Dust Cup Filter Save money and lessen waste by washing and reusing the allergy-reducing filter. • Low Profile Cleaning Nozzle Reaches under furniture and close to baseboards. • Foot Controlled, 7-Setting Height Adjustment Easily adjust to clean most floor surfaces. • EZ Roll® Soft Wheels Wheels won’t scratch or nick hard floors. The control switch diverts the suction power to where you need it the most- the floor or the hose Allows you to empty the dust cup quickly and easily without touching the captured dust Eureka has engineered SuctionSeal™ to provide maximum suction power Eureka’s multi-cyclonic dust cup system never loses suction and maintains power Save money and lessen waste by washing and reusing the allergy-reducing filter Whether it’s surface dirt or debris hiding in crevices, it’s sucked up and away without any scattering","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41-QD-RzndL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"EUREKA","source_asin":"B007TG7E8E","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-317228","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B007TG7E8E","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B007TG7E8E","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
