window.products.push({"id":317312,"name":"DHSFKBE Boho Comforter Set King - 7 Pieces Bed in a Bag Floral Medallions Design, Bohemian Comforter Set with Sheets, Soft Microfiber Complete Bedding","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":61.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/813FrCV6DgL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Fashionable Decoration: A vibrant design with this king bed in a bag. This king size comforter set with sheets botanical details in shades of blue, yellow, and red on a white background floral medallion and bird print in vivid colors with a solid peacock blue reverse, for a pleasant boho look. Reactive printing technology which has better moisture absorption than ordinary printing, high colorfastness. Ultra-Soft and Comfortable: Our boho comforter set king is made with polyester microfiber and cotton-polyester fill. It’s super soft and silky. Skin-friendly fabric adds softness to provide you with exceptional comfort. The superior quality comforter is comfortable, breathable, and not easy to shrink. The quilting process makes the filler even and not easy to agglomerate which can fix the quilt core. 7 Pieces Bed in a Bag: DHSFKBE king size comforter set includes - 1 comforter (104\" x 90\") + 2 pillow shams (20\" x 36\") + 2 pillowcases (20\" x 40\") + 1 flat sheet (108\" x 102\") + 1 fitted sheet (78\" x 80\" + 16\"). It’s so soft and well made, especially for this price. This boho modern teal bed in a bag is a warm gift for sisters, friends, daughter, families and our lovers. Color Remind & Satisfactory Service: Product pictures are real shot. Due to the shooting of the light and the different display, there may be a color difference. The specific color is subject to the actual product received. If you have any needs or questions, let us know via amazon email and we will give you a timely solution. Easy Care: Our turquoise bed in a bag is packaged in a vacuum bag, so you can dry it in low heat or tap the comforter gently while baking it in the sun to fluffy again. The bedding comforter sets are machine washable which can save us more time and energy. It's highly recommend to wash it in the gentle cycle with cold water, sun-dry or tumble dry in low.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/813FrCV6DgL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"DHSFKBE","source_asin":"B0BGMXF1SL","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-317312","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BGMXF1SL","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BGMXF1SL","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
