window.products.push({"id":317455,"name":"Nambe - Holiday Collection - Miniature Nativity Shepherd and Lamb - Set of Two Figures - Made with Nambe Alloy - Designed by Alvaro Uribe","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":39.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61+DJdJpCkL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"THE LORD IS MY SHEPHERD: Often depicted used as a Biblical symbol, the birth of Jesus would not be complete without the shepherd. The miniature shepherd stands with his wooden staff and little lamb as a loving onlooker to the Holy Family. Complete your Miniature Nativity set with the addition of these two precious pieces, sure to be treasured for years to come. AWAY IN A MANGER: Celebrate the Christmas season with the Holy Family. The Miniature Nativity Set crafted in lustrous Nambé Alloy and rich acacia wood keeps the true meaning of the holiday at the forefront of your holiday decor. Build your manager scene piece by piece or year by year or gather them all at once for a full and bright Christmas collection. DISCOVERY DRIVEN DESIGNER: Alvaro Uribe is an award winning Industrial designer, founder of Alvaro Uribe Design a New York based design studio dedicated to discovering new forms, functions, materials and values for products. Uribe lives and works in Brooklyn, New York and serves as an Adjunct Professor at Pratt Institute. MUSEUM QUALITY DESIGN: Recognized for its award-winning designs for more than 60 years, Nambe's commitment to timeless beauty, artistic integrity and uncompromising quality is evident in the brand's collection of serve ware, barware, home décor and gift items. Nambe collaborates with the world's most esteemed designers to develop products that bring function and style into the home. PRODUCT SPECIFICATIONS: Package contains (1) Nambe Miniature Nativity Shepherd and Lamb– Includes a miniature shepherd with his wooden staff and little lamb. Made of Nambé Alloy and Acacia Wood. Shepherd measures: 2” W x 4.5” H. Lamb: 2” L x 1” H. Care instructions: Wipe clean with dry cloth. Designed by Alvaro Uribe as a part of the Miniature Nativity Collection.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61+DJdJpCkL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"nambe","source_asin":"B01JTJCOH4","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-317455","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01JTJCOH4","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01JTJCOH4","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
