window.products.push({"id":317536,"name":"shayier China Intangible Cultural Heritage - Chinese Color Handmade Paper-Cut (Plum & Orchid & Bamboo & Chrysanthemum)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":6.8,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91Su9L0F5yL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Paper-cuts in China Paper-cut is a gorgeous and wonderful work in China’s treasure house. It has its own unique features and enjoys a long history, which is one of the most popular folk traditional Chinese decoration arts with most characteristic. It is simple and fresh, which touches people greatly; it is tender and pure, which wins people’s praise; it is also unrestrained and natural, which is respected and rewarded by all of us. As embodiment of China’s original philosophy, the paper-cut has features of being comprehensive, beatified and lucky. In the meanwhile, with special expression, it conveys connotation and essence of traditional culture. It not only stands for people’s ability to appreciate arts, but also manifests deep level of social psychology in China. No matter colorful paper-cut with local characteristics, being simple, elegant, and natural or only-color and multi-color paper-cut which are fine and dedicate with smooth lines and suitable density, it is hard for any other paintings to compare with it, for the paper-cut was listed as “world cultural heritage” by UNESCO. Plum&Orchid&Bamboo&Chrysanthemum Plum , orchid , bamboo, chrysanthemum, the four flowers known as the four gentlemen, the Chinese sense of ambition symbol, respectively on behalf of proud, quiet, firm, light four character. It is rooted in this aesthetic personality realm of fascination, but also chanting poetry and artists in the common theme. 梅：探波傲雪，剪雪裁冰，一身傲骨，是为高洁志士兰：空谷幽放，孤芳自赏，香雅怡情，是为世上贤达竹：筛风弄月，潇洒一生，清雅澹泊，是为谦谦君子菊：凌霜飘逸，特立独行，不趋炎势，是为世外隐士","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91Su9L0F5yL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"shayier","source_asin":"B01MYQD6MG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-317536","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01MYQD6MG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01MYQD6MG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
