window.products.push({"id":317574,"name":"Calmbee Plastic Wrap Dispenser with Cutter and Ziplock Bag organizer, 9 IN 1 Bamboo Foil and Plastic Wrap Organizer for Kitchen Drawer, Ziplock Bag St","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":49.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71iQez9UFRL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"FROM MESSY TO TIDY: Are you frustarated with opening the drawers that had the ziplok bags and plastic wrap as they would always cause the drawer to get stuck? Here is the solution. Cut the clutter and have a organized kitchen drawer with our plastic wrap dispenser with cutter and baggie organizer.Your drawer will change to be a organizer’s dream. ALL IN 1 BAGGIE&WRAP ORGANIZER : ① This sets contains 3 in 1 foil and wrap dispenser with cutter, perfect for Aluminum foil, plastic wrap, wax paper. Please kindly note: only fits wrap rolls that length is≤12 inch, and diameter≤2 inch. ② Food storage bag organizer: compatible with Ziploc, Solimo, Hefty, Glad, Up&Up & GreatValue storage, freezer and slider bag of sandwich, quart, snack and gallon. ③Drawer Organizer Storage Box is for extra organization for your clips or other little stuff. 100% NATURE BAMBOO AND CRAFTSMANSHIP: This plastic wrap dispenser with ziplock bag organizer is made of premium bamboo. Well-constructed quality and excellent craftsmanship make it more solid and durable to last for years. Bamboo is a great alternative to plastic as it is a renewable resource and it will add a warm, natural feel to the kitchen. DETACHABLE & CONNECTABLE USE: The wrap rolls organizer is designed to meet your different needs. It can be connected to hang on the wall, or detached to put on your drawer or counter according to your space. Organize your different wrap rolls and ziplock bag in an more convenient manner. BUILT-IN SLIDER CUTTER &LABELS INCLUDED: Innovative slide cutter to get the job done quickly and effortlessly! You will just need to pull out the wrap from the dispenser, and then, slide the knob on your dispenser to cut it. Assorted labels included to help you identify your wraps or bags easily.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71iQez9UFRL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Calmbee","source_asin":"B09XK4PK4M","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-317574","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09XK4PK4M","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09XK4PK4M","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
