window.products.push({"id":317608,"name":"AMIR Electronic Milligram Scale, Rechargeable Precision Portable Scale with Calibration Weights and Tweezers, 0.001-20g Professional Reloading Digital","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":16.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/7145082QLKL._SL1500_.jpg","description":"Calibration Function: If you find any inaccuracies in the scale throughout your use, simply use the 20g calibration weight that came with the scale and recalibrate it according to the calibration method, and you can continue to use your scale accurately! Ultra-clear display: large LCD display, blue backlight, clear and easy to read numerical display. Scale has a horizontal column and adjustable height quadrant pads, ideal for harsh environments where it is clear whether the scale is on the horizontal plane or not, allowing for more accurate and efficient measurements. Hight Precision Scale: Using high precision sensor system to get accurate readings every time, 20g capacity and 0.001g accuracy. 6 units to choose from: g, oz, ozt, dwt, ct, gn, suitable for a variety of weighing measurements, whether you are weighing drug ingredients, powder, gold or anything else, very suitable. Tare function: Electronic scales have a tare function, which is ideal for items that are difficult to weigh and need to be placed in a container or stacked for weighing, simply place the container or tray on the scale, press the tare function, and then place the item in the container/tray. Pocket Scale - With wind-shelter to prevent influencing the weighing accuracy by the interference of external environment. Complimentary 2 AAA batteries, USB emergency power cable, 20G calibration weights and tweezers.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/7145082QLKL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"AMIR","source_asin":"B0BW3BF12X","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-317608","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BW3BF12X","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BW3BF12X","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
