window.products.push({"id":317734,"name":"100 Pieces Fiber Reed Diffuser Replacement Refill Sticks (10\" x 3mm, Beige)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":10.98,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51MUhb00vKL._AC_SL1108_.jpg","description":"Perfect Look: Exactly same kind:the same color,style,and size.Free of flash and won't bend. Bring out your texture of the diffuser set. The Color Never Run: Our colored fibre diffuser sticks do not bleed color in both of oil base & water base diffuser liquid. We have advanced technology to produce colored fibre diffuser sticks do not bleed color in both of oil base and water base diffuser liquid. Easy to Use: Simply place fiber sticks into diffuser bottle,  the oil will saturate into sticks, and as it wicks up it will release the aroma into the air. Specification: Material: Polyester cotton  Item Size: 10\" (25cm) x 3mm Diameter Color: Beige Assorted Available: 100 Pcs Note: It will take a few days for the reeds to absorb the oil then carry the scent into the air. Different oil with different time,we highly appreciate your understanding. To intensify fragrance, turn sticks up side down once a week. For best result, replace sticks once a month.The working principle of such sticks is adsorption and volatilization, which is a relatively slow adsorption process. If you want these sticks to work as soon as possible, immerse the sticks in the essential oil and, after soaking, invert the sticks and reinsert into the essential oil.Sometimes your method of use, the quality of the oil, the environment and other factors, will affect the volatility effect.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51MUhb00vKL._AC_SL1108_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Ougual","source_asin":"B075XYWFX1","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-317734","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B075XYWFX1","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B075XYWFX1","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
