window.products.push({"id":317791,"name":"Scanpan 11pc Deluxe Cookware Set with 6-Quart Stockpot","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41JYVG4AQ9L._AC_.jpg","description":"Product Description NONSTICK WITHOUT COMPROMISE - SCANPAN defies every conventional assumption about traditional nonstick surfaces. It browns, braises and deglazes like professional cookware. All of this is delivered on a revolutionary nonstick surface that requires little to no oil for healthier cooking. Cleaning requires only soap and water with little effort. SCANPAN is made to let you have it all. All SCANPAN products are made of recycled aluminum and manufactured under the strictest of standards required by the Danish government. SCANPAN is a family-run business based in Ryomgaard, Denmark. For more than five decades, SCANPAN has been producing durable and timeless artisan cookware for professional chefs and home cooks. Safety and sustainability are part of SCANPAN’s DNA. Amazon.com An ideal grouping of basic sizes and shapes for a well-equipped kitchen, this high-quality 11-piece cookware set consists of a 10-1/2-inch fry pan, 11-inch covered sauté pan, 1-quart covered saucepan, 2-quart covered saucepan with left- and right-hand pouring spouts, 3-quart covered saucepan, and 6-1/2-quart covered Dutch oven. Charcoal gray inside and out, Scanpan pots and pans are made with pressure-forged 7-millimeter-thick aluminum, eliminating hot spots and providing fast, even heat distribution. The nonstick properties of the cooking surfaces are guaranteed not to diminish over a lifetime of use, and, unlike most nonstick cookware, metal utensils won't harm the ceramic-titanium surface. The black plastic handles with hanging holes and knobbed glass lids are oven-safe to 500 degrees F. Cleanup is easy--warm water and soap plus an occasional scrub with an included scouring pad. --Victoria Jenkins What's in the Box 1-quart saucepan with lid, 2-quart saucepan with lid, 3-quart saucepan with lid, 6-1/2-quart Dutch oven with lid, 11-inch sauté pan with lid, 10-1/2-inch fry pan","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41JYVG4AQ9L._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Scanpan","source_asin":"B00004S4TR","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-317791","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00004S4TR","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00004S4TR","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
