window.products.push({"id":317793,"name":"Disney Frozen, \"Make Magic\" Double Sided Cloud Throw Blanket, 50\" x 60\", Multi Color, 1 Count","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/A1boGxcJOVL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Make your own magic happen with this Disney's Frozen \"make magic\" cloud throw by The Northwest Company. This throw is so soft and cozy, you will never want to get up from your Nap! the first time you touch our cloud throw definitely won't be the last, as it feels like pure silk! the front displays a picture of your favourite inseparable sisters, Elsa and Anna, creating their own magic, bringing you warmth! the back of this 50\"x 60\" double sided throw is a repeating print of Anna and Elsa and their beautiful Castle. Bring this throw to your next sleepover and everyone will want to cuddle up next to you! 100Percent polyester. Machine washable.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/A1boGxcJOVL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Northwest","source_asin":"B0812PG64G","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-317793","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0812PG64G","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0812PG64G","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":317794,"name":"Neanderthal Man Primitive Artifacts Aterian Genuine Archeological Stemmed Tools ~3\" (Qty=1)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/618cgfcx93L._AC_SL1001_.jpg","description":"This is a beautiful Genuine Rare primitive man Neanderthal technology artifact . It is from the what is now the Sahara desert .It is over 3 \" long and 1 1/4\" wide, large size;t he colors are browns in its finest and natural state; this treasure would definitely make a very rare and collectable piece; not for gem cutting nor carving. It is from the Late Middle Stone Age Era to Upper/Middle Paleolithic Era; it is 55,000 to 12,000 years old. These were used on spears, and as arrowheads, scrapers, and knives. Aterian tools from the now Sahara Desert were used by both Cro Magnon Man and Neanderthals; the tool making technology is in the Mousterian Lithic tradition and called Levallois; 1 specified buys 1 artifact, 3 buys 3 artifacts, etc. item shipped will vary slightly","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/618cgfcx93L._AC_SL1001_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"uMuseum","source_asin":"B00B2C9BZK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-317794","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00B2C9BZK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00B2C9BZK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
