window.products.push({"id":317822,"name":"Toilet Bowl Brush and Holder, HESAIN 3 Pack Toilet Brush with Ventilated Holder, Bathroom Accessories Toilet Bowl Cleaners with Silicone Bristles, Flo","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61JF5f1B4ML._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"HESAIN 3-pack toilet brush is made of premium PP handle and TPR brush head, not easy to deform, not easy to tangle hair, and fits snugly to clean dead spots. The dedicated hangable toilet brush holder is designed to be ventilated and drip-proof, keeping your bathroom clean and hygienic.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61JF5f1B4ML._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"HESAIN","source_asin":"B0BFX3G2CG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-317822","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BFX3G2CG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BFX3G2CG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":317823,"name":"d-c-fix Window Privacy Film Frost Premium Static Cling Removable Two Way Day and Night Sun UV-Blocking Decorative Vinyl Covering for Bathroom, Office,","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":18.39,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61p1o0INyiL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Product Description d-c-fix static cling window films offer function and design in one product. The d-c-fix static glass film protects you again curious eyes as it filters sunlight glare and UV radiation (up to 95%). Due to its static cling technology, it is particularly easy to apply, as it adheres to glass surfaces without adhesive. The film adheres to the glass surface using water, which later dries out leaving a flawless finish with no air bubbles. Application is easy: 1) Cut the film to the required size using the handy grid on the back for accurate measurement. 2) Spray water onto desired surface.3) Start by separating the backing at the top position film and gently begin peeling the backing paper as you smooth film using a d-c-fix applicator or cloth to remove air bubbles. Surfaces covered with d-c-fix products can be washed and maintained with warm soapy water and can be easily changed for new designs. It can be removed just as easily, without leaving residue, for repositioning and reuse. Whether you’re looking for some privacy for an overlooked window or would just like to add some decoration to plain glass, d-c-fix static films offer a wide range of designs in varying sized rolls to fit any area of glass. From the Manufacturer Based in Weissbach, Germany, d-c-fix is proud to be a part of the Konrad Hornschuch AG Group. Under the d-c-fix brand, Hornchuch UK manufactures and retails premium quality vinyl coverings and veneers for all types of household surfaces, as well as tablecloths, anti-slip mats, flooring and other homeware products. We sell to large DIY contractors, distributors, small independent retailers and online retailers. Our products are all manufactured in Weissbach, Germany where we uphold the highest standards of quality and service. As leaders in the vinyl design industry, we are always looking into the latest innovations and technologies to improve our products and workflow. Inspired by modern design trends, our large selection interior design products are created with to appeal to all tastes and styles.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61p1o0INyiL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"d-c-fix","source_asin":"B005GJW8GY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-317823","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B005GJW8GY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B005GJW8GY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
