window.products.push({"id":317838,"name":"Rae Dunn Christmas Gnome Love - 19 Inch Stuffed Plush Santa Figurine Doll with Felt Hat - Cute Ornaments and Holiday Decorations for Home Decor and Of","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":24.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71+sAxNujxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Experience the magic of the Holiday Season with this cute Christmas Gnome from Rae Dunn! With felt nose, white fiber beard, knitted arms and plush body this little Santa gnome has a cute pointed cap with a fun holiday themed message in Rae Dunn’s signature font. FEATURES: Soft Plush Felt Traditional Good Luck Charm Weighted with Sand Dimensions: 19.25” x 7” x 5.25” Multiple styles and colors avialable! CELEBRATE IN STYLE Be transported to a fairytale world of wonder & whimsy with these adorable self-standing plush gnomes. These mythological beings from Nordic folklore – called “nisse” or “tomten” – are associated with the winter solstice and the Christmas season. They are generally described as being short, having a long white beard, and wearing a conical or knit cap in a bright color. Our nifty gnome is 19.5” tall and has a bottom filled with sand so he stays upright without toppling over. Adorn bedrooms, desktops, nurseries, offices, tables, mantles, windowsills, bookcases, shelves, refrigerators, nooks and crannies with this plush figurine and keep the mood fun & festive! RAE DUNN California artist, ceramicist and author, Rae Dunn , finds beauty in simple shapes, imperfection and found objects. “In my own way, I am driven to find the balance between expressing something that is deeply meaningful to me and creating a sense of joy that might quietly touch the lives of others.” Rae’s designs are known for their functionality, design and durability. Rae’s signature font gives every item a personal touch and adds to the simple beauty of her designs.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71+sAxNujxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Rae Dunn","source_asin":"B08LXKHNXS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-317838","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08LXKHNXS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08LXKHNXS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
