window.products.push({"id":317843,"name":"GCOA 3 Pack Ice Cream Scoop Stainless Steel with Trigger, Cookie Scoop Melon Baller Set Professional,for Ice Cream, Fruit, Mashed Food, Baking - 3 Dif","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41Vi5AilLqL._AC_.jpg","description":"Ice Cream Scoop, 3PCS Stainless Steel With Trigger Cookie Spoons Set. Three different size ice cream spoons: Small(ball diameter: 4 cm), middle(ball diameter: 5 cm)and large(ball diameter: 6 cm). Made of stainless steel with a high polished finish. Perfect for hard and soft ice creams and cookies, or any other food. A must have for your kitchen.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41Vi5AilLqL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"GCOA","source_asin":"B07MKQ4JMD","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-317843","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07MKQ4JMD","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07MKQ4JMD","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":317844,"name":"Acacia Wood Plate, Plate Square, Set of 4, Acacia Square Plates, Acacia Wood Square Serving, Acaciaware 7\" , Acacia Wood Square Serving Tray, Acacia W","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71+hemx6KzL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Acaciaware, by Nice & Nature, is the highest quality and best valued Acacia woodenware available on the market; the plates are hand carved from Acacia hardwood. Acaciaware is a dense, naturally resinous hardwood which, by its very nature, resists penetration by water and will not absorb stains or odors. Use the Acaciaware Square Serving Tray / Plate every day and use it on special occasions – the exquisite craftsmanship, gorgeous color and natural design will make a special occasion out of any occasion. Acaciaware also means easy care. Hand wash with warm soapy water and air dry. It doesn’t typically require oil but, if for some reason it appears to be drying out, simply use a non-toxic mineral oil to restore the wood grain to its original beauty. Creating high quality woodenware is not Nice & Nature only concernwe are also concerned about the environment. Their wood sources do not harm the environment by using slash and burn methods of harvesting trees. All of their wood is harvested with care meaning that the trees they use are harvested legally from privately owned lands. Nice & Nature cares about sustaining the environment and are constantly looking for wood sources. Richly grained acacia wood turns out in smooth, , naturally suited to everyday use, entertaining or artful display. Each piece is given a clear lacquer finish to bring out the wood's warm color and individual markings. Harvested from well-managed forests in Thailand. Nice & Nature product is the locally made product of each Thai Tambon (sub-district). It consisted of OTOP. The reason that we would like to promote our brand because to support local people have job to do and can work at home as a homemade. It’s like a family business so that they can work and then stay with their family.We encourage village communities to improve the local products' quality and to join e-commerce project.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71+hemx6KzL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Nice & Nature","source_asin":"B00YABAM26","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-317844","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00YABAM26","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00YABAM26","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":317845,"name":"Prepac Walnut Coal Harbor Mate Platform Storage Bed, Full, Warm Cherry","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61D7b0yKa6L._AC_SL1280_.jpg","description":"Expand the storage potential of your bedroom with the Coal Harbor Full Mate’s Platform Storage Bed with 6 Drawers. Use the six 18” deep drawers (three on each side) included in this mate’s bed to stow away blankets, linens and anything else that won’t quite fit into your other bedroom furniture, and conserve floor space while you’re at it. You won’t need a box spring, either, thanks to the slat support system that requires only a mattress. As a final touch, the footboard’s angular shape echoes the detail seen in the other members of the Coal Harbor Bedroom Collection, making it easy to unify your bedroom’s style.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61D7b0yKa6L._AC_SL1280_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Prepac","source_asin":"B007K8AZBY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-317845","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B007K8AZBY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B007K8AZBY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":317846,"name":"HYLEORY Full Size Waterproof Mattress Pad Protector, Breathable Quilted Mattress Cover Noiseless Waterproof Fitted Sheet Mattress Topper Upto 21\" Deep","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":24.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61xHunvT2PL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"WATERPROOF MATTRESS PAD: In the past, you had to wash your mattress regularly if you spilled drinks, sweat or urine on the top accidentally. Now, this waterproof TPU backing will protect your mattress from these fluids. Thus extending its life and reducing the hassle of regular cleaning. It is more suitable for families with pregnant women, the elderly and pets.​ Also suitable for the moistureproof of Air Mattress outdoors PREMIUM SURFACE & FILLS: The surface of the mattress protector is made of skin-friendly fabric that is covered with dense fuzz. High elastic fiber has superior sweat absorption. And breathable and free from clumping. Filled with hollow fiber polyester, which can store a large amount of air, ensure fluffy and warm. The fuzz fabric and elastic microfibers make mattress protectors quieter and give you an uninterrupted night's sleep 360°DEEP POCKET PROTECTION: This mattress protector features a bed skirt made of highly stretchy fabric which is highly malleable, allowing for extensions up to 21 inches. The 360° bed skirt is designed to easily wrap the entire mattress, keeping the mattress protector in one position in any sleeping position, ensuring that the mattress protector will not move easily PROFESSIONAL DESIGN & CRAFTSMANSHIP: Our mattress protector is box quilted, the interior microfiber is filled evenly and smoothly. Prevent night fill shifting from affecting sleep. And combed fibers make the filling more fluffy and soft.Excellent waterproof design allows you to sleep without worrying about fluids, sweat or urine leaking through the protector to damage your precious mattress. Give you peace of mind at night MACHINE WASHING & EASY CARE: Cold water separate machine wash, convenient and fast. Do not dry clean, iron or use bleach. When washing, make sure the mattress cover is unrolled with waterproof backing facing in. Do not use laundry balls to avoid damage to the TPU backing","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61xHunvT2PL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"HYLEORY","source_asin":"B0B876FV9W","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-317846","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B876FV9W","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B876FV9W","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
