window.products.push({"id":317862,"name":"Leggett & Platt QB0019 Ava 5-Piece Comforter and Pillow Sham Daybed Ensemble, Twin","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/819Zt6kA2cL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The Ava is part of Fashion Bed Group’s Elite bedding collection that offers outstanding features usually reserved for luxury linens costing twice as much. Cream with black medallions across the bottom, center comforter textured like pillow shams for a very stylish and luxurious look and feel to this beautiful new ensemble. This set is a 5-piece Twin sized daybed ensemble that includes (1) Comforter, (1) Bed Skirt and (3) Shams. All collections come in one-box packaging and we’re sure you’ll be pleased with the quality that does into each piece. All styles and preferences are crafted from the finest materials, giving an unmistakable feel of unmatched quality. The comforters are deep-quilted, hand-packed, and has twisted-rope cording or self-cording detail on 3-sides. The Shams are tailored, ruffled, or piped with an envelope-style closure. The pleated Bed Skirt comes tailored or gathered with split corners cut for a full 15-inch drop. Fashion Bed Group’s wide selection of styles will provide the perfect finishing touch for any bedroom. The Fashion Bed Group, a division of globally diversified Leggett & Platt Inc., is an industry leader in the production of fashionable beds, adjustable bed bases, top of bed textiles, bedding support and barstools. By keeping a close eye on the design community and other fashion and decorating sources, Fashion Bed Group stays on top of the trends and knows the right mix of finishes and innovative designs to continually provide quality crafted products at an exceptional value.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/819Zt6kA2cL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Leggett & Platt","source_asin":"B016E5ZUU4","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-317862","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B016E5ZUU4","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B016E5ZUU4","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":317863,"name":"FEOMOS One Way Mirror Film Daytime Privacy Glass Film Removable Window Tint Non Adhesive Relective Static Window Films Sun Protection UV Blocking Heat","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61c2XjRHoQL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"NON ADHESIVE & REMOVABLE - This one way window film is static cling which means it can be installed with just water and no ahesive or glue is needed. It can be easily used and removed without residue left. You can even reused it if you keep it well. We recommend that you wrap the squeegee with a flannel when you squeegee water and bubbles to prevent damage to the film. HEAT INSULATION - Our solar control window films are are the most efficient at controlling excess heat as they both absorb and reflect excess heat, keeping your house cool in summer and retaining heat in winter. It's an efficient tool to enhance your comfort, and to help reduce your energy costs and energy consumption, and to lower your carbon footprint through savings in air conditioning costs. UV RAYS REJECTION - One way window film protects against UV rays, it cuts 85% of infrared rays and 97% of UV rays which are the main cause of fading of valuable furnishings, carpets and wooden floors. DAYTIME PRIVACY PROTECTION - Our reflective window film gives your glass a mirror finish when viewed externally. The high reflective silver finish when combined with sunlight will restrict the view through the glass. However, the reflective mirror effect will not work at night or on dull days due to the lack of sunlight. SUITABLE FOR VARIOUS SPACES - We recommand to use it on internal windows or glass partitions, and the film is suitable for all types of glazing as long as the glass is flat and smooth. It's ideal for office windows, shop windows and home windows and doors.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61c2XjRHoQL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"FEOMOS","source_asin":"B08GFNLXZ7","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-317863","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08GFNLXZ7","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08GFNLXZ7","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
