window.products.push({"id":317929,"name":"Moose Lodge Lightweight Bedspread Coverlet - All Season King Bedding Cover with Shams,Plaid Bear Deer Printed Quilt Set Bedding Set,Rustic Country Cab","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":39.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71sj4YDl9LL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"KING SIZE BED SET: Western Lodge style light weight 3 piece set include:1 Quilt (96 x 108 inches) and 2 Pillow Cases (36 x 20 inches); An artificial patchwork jungle wild animal plants printed on the whole spread and same buffalo plaid on back: Rich claret, gray and earth tones meet pale taupe accents in this woodsy bedding set; Bears,deer, trees,and plaid patterns decorate the quilts;These patterns are perfect for a lodge or cabin-themed rooms; The set comfortably fits single bed or twin bed CHECKED DESIGN: This reversible bedding collection will be beautiful in your rustic cabin, log home,cottage, lodge, lakehouse, mountain home, or country home; One side of the light-weight bed quilt features a cabin forest scene with earth tones of white, brown, green, khaki, caramel and black colors, a row of black bears, deer head, moose,leaves, pine tree, forest, wood and pine cone; The other side features check or tartan patterns design for a versatile look, perfect as a home or bedroom decor VERSATILE USE: This coverlet is featherweight and comfortable to use in summer or as a decorative cover over a heavy blanket in colder weather; it can also be used as a blanket,duvet cover,bed sheet; This quilt set incorporating unique designs, rustic pattern and plaid, both sides could be used individually; Beautiful pattern make this bed spread set is a great gift idea for weddings, birthdays, holidays; Suitable for men, women, boys,girls, kids, teens of all age EASY CARE: Machine wash in cold water separately, tumble dry low, don't overdry; No shrinkage, low color fading,anti-wrinkle after washing; The best way to keep colors from fading is to wash your bedding as little and as gently as possible, Or better yet, not at all; The water, the friction from agitation, the detergent, and the drying—all of these contribute to pulling out that bright color from your bedding; Some people may feel a little stiff for this quilt, it will soften after washing SATISFACTION GUARANTEED: Customer satisfaction is vital importance to us., you can contact us or replacement or refund if you are unsatisfied within 30-day, just to make sure the inner package is intact; All items are taken in kind, for display, light, environmental reasons may be a slight deviation phenomenon, please in kind prevail and the length between individuals will have slight differences due to the quilts are pure handmade and method of measurement will also cause the deviation","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71sj4YDl9LL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Belista","source_asin":"B08Y6JW6TV","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-317929","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08Y6JW6TV","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08Y6JW6TV","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":317930,"name":"ISLAND BAMBOO 13` Wooden Bamboo Toast Tongs, 1 EA","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61wpvotYDrL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"With the Island Bamboo Toast Tongs, you will never again risk burning or shocking yourself while trying to pry your bread from the toaster with a fork. These tongs can be used with bagels, English muffins, and home made breads as well. This versatile tool keeps hands far away from hot toasters and ovens. Safe to use without unplugging the toaster, Island Bamboo Toast Tongs are flexible enough to grasp even the thinnest piece of bread and provide a comfortable grip for slippery hands. They are crafted with a special glue which is safe for use in the dishwasher. The beautiful caramelized finish is dishwasher safe as well. Toast tongs are the perfect addition to any kitchen. Island Bamboo specializes in creating beautiful bamboo products for your home. Durable and long-lasting, it is 16-percent harder than hardwoods like Maple and Oak. And most importantly, bamboo is one the worlds' most renewable resources, with incredibly fast growth rates. Bamboo Island products are unique, functional, and attractive and make a perfect gift for holidays, weddings, or any occasion. We pride ourselves on our innovative designs and quality craftsmanship. Bamboo is 16-percent harder than maple making bamboo a better solid surface for cutting. Of note, Island Bamboo uses a specific bamboo called 'Moso' which is not a food source for the Giant Panda. Care Instructions: Simply hand wash with soap and warm water then dry thoroughly.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61wpvotYDrL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Island Bamboo","source_asin":"B002UUU5TY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-317930","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B002UUU5TY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B002UUU5TY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
