window.products.push({"id":317960,"name":"Green Bathroom Rug, Ultra Soft Microfiber Shaggy Bathroom Mats, 20''x 32'', Extra Absorbent Bath Rugs, Machine Washable/Dry, Non-Slip Bathroom Carpet ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":23.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71q0njmBzWL._AC_SL1400_.jpg","description":"☁ [SOFT & COMFORTABLE] - This mint green bath mat uses ultra-soft and plush, shaggy microfibers for that sensational, cloud-like feeling when you step out of the shower. The bathroom mats use a cute and elegant daisy pattern lends a beautiful rich decor element to your bathroom, and fill your home with spring and summer vibes all year round. ☁ [NON-SLIP BACKING & SAFE] - The backside of the bath rug for bathroom features an ultra-durable and non-slip TPR Backing (not PVC or glue) for long-lasting use and a superb grip, it's more safe and cozy. Please place bathroom rug on dry smooth floor. ☁ [SUPERIOR ABSORBENCY] - The bath mats for bathroom non slip are made of plush microfiber which traps water and keeps your floors clean and dry. The shaggy fibers absorb moisture and dry quickly after you step out of the shower, keeping your feet dry and warm. And the water will not stay on the surface of the bathroom rug. ☁ [EASY CARE] - Our bathroom rugs are easy to clean, and you can conveniently be thrown in any washing machine and gently tumble dry on low. Super soft microfiber material will not shrink or turn rough even after the wash, which will keep your rug same for very long time. Use only non-chlorine bleach when needed. Make sure to machine wash cold and tumble dry on low. ☁ [NOT JUST FOR THE BATH] - This bathroom rugs can be used as a comfortable, water-absorbent and non-slip surface to stand on for your living room, bedroom, front of the sink, kitchen, bathroom sink, tub-side, shower, or at any place in your home where you want support and warmth on your toes . If you have any problem or suggestion with our bathroom floor carpet, please kindly contact us freely, we provide friendly, easy-to-reach support for you.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71q0njmBzWL._AC_SL1400_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ANNARUGER","source_asin":"B09THX98VT","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-317960","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09THX98VT","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09THX98VT","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
