window.products.push({"id":317968,"name":"NOVICA Romantic Love Suar Wood Abstract Human Figure Sculpture, 7.5\" Tall 'Indivisible Love'","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":38.24,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71g+Jsjiv+L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"NOVICA, in association with National Geographic, works together with talented artisan designers around the world to produce stunning, keepsake treasures. Our mantra is to spread global happiness, so rest assured - we’ll do everything we possibly can to ensure you’re a happy customer. About this item: Lithe flowing curves in an abstract conception create a magical effect in this stunning piece, exhibiting Wayan Rendah's mastery over his art. The sculpture mirrors the indivisible love between two people whose joined hands symbolize a profound spiritual union. The oval forms also evoke the intertwined symbol of infinity, adding a timeless quality to this spectacular piece. - Each artwork is unique -- wood grain, color, and pattern will differ slightly from picture About our Artist: Wayan Rendah's father began teaching him to sculpt when he was a boy. 'Balinese woodcarving touches me very deeply. I have learned a variety of arts in Bali, such as gamelan dance, but carving a piece of wood gives me an incomparable sensation,' he says. 'After I finished school, I studied further because I needed more experience, and the tools and material I needed were beyond my financial reach. Exploring the abstract world refreshes my mind in creating new carvings.'","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71g+Jsjiv+L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"NOVICA","source_asin":"B00011V2W8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-317968","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00011V2W8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00011V2W8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
